* ''House canon rests at contract; its CIDs read public'' (operator, 2026-11-11: //"veil ⊂ persona-group ⊂ contract ⊂ public -> Those note the 'access posture' for CRDTs, and the CRDTs for the canon rest under Kahu cabal contract. The CIDs are public."//). The cap tiers name a CRDT's access posture and nest by inclusion. The house canon (`houseCanonSlugs`: `lares` and `lararium` always, every disk-sourced holding but the public board `crossroads`) rests live in the Kahu realm at contract; the Kahu steward alone writes it, every other face reads the floor, and the published snapshots travel by CID to every DreamNet user. No separate vessel tier stands. Landed (`a3d3dbed5`; <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/cap-tier#/house-canon`>>).

